                "text": "Republicans are trying to pass a budget that would destroy Medicaid and cut coverage for the most vulnerable.\n\nDo you know what is also included? $4.5 trillion in tax breaks to the ultra-rich.\n\nThat's not right and we're fighting back. https://t.co/phIG2fWaBV",
