                "retweet_count": 13,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "1.3 million Minnesotans who depend on Medicaid - are at risk of losing their coverage.\n\n@KellyMorrisonMN and I hosted a roundtable at Hennepin Healthcare to sound the alarm on the devastating impact of these GOP cuts & ensure Minnesotans can access the critical care they need. https://t.co/XEdT3yRAUB",
