                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Nearly 14 million people (and likely more) by 2034 would lose health coverage and become uninsured. \n\nThat includes 8.6 million Americans who rely on Medicaid and the ACA Marketplace to access the affordable, life-saving health care they need.",
