                "retweet_count": 23,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans' cruel cuts to Medicaid will devastate the ability of urban and rural hospitals, like Robbinsdale's North Memorial, to stay afloat and continue to provide the community with the critical care they need.\n\nI'm doing everything in my power to fight back and get the resources Minnesotans need.",
