                "retweet_count": 86,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "I\u2019m proud to co-lead the End Prescription Drug Ads Now Act with @SenSanders, @RepJerryNadler, and @RepDexterOR.\n\nBig Pharma spends billions marketing drugs to patients instead of making them affordable. \n\nMedical decisions should be made with the help of your doctor, not a marketing team.",
