                "retweet_count": 129,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The top 6 health insurance CEOs pocketed $159.4 million in total compensation last year, while Americans are paying more for less coverage. \n\nMedicare for All would stop this exploitation in its tracks.",
