                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "If we don\u2019t seize this moment to counteract their cruelty, premiums will skyrocket 75 percent next year for over 20 million Americans who rely on the Affordable Care Act credits. Over 4 million Americans will lose health coverage.",
