                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Too much is at stake. Children could lose access to life-saving medications. Seniors may be forced to skip doctor visits. Cancer patients could be forced to forgo their chemotherapy treatment. This is the real cost of Republican cruelty.",
